  "project_description": "This is a noUiSlider integration for Drupal. It provides a noUiSlider\n\nelement for select list and entity reference fields.\n\n Kudos to nikathone for his initial work on this project.\n\n Features \n The module convert a view exposed multi select filter to NoUiSlider widget for better UI experience.\n\n Post-Installation \n When enabled, the module will add a new option (NoUiSlider) to Better Exposed Filter settings\n\ninside the View.\n\n Additional Requirements \n This module requires the following modules:\n\n Better Exposed Filters \n\n And the following library:\n\n noUiSlider \n\n Back to top",
